Package: rhythmCI
Type: Package
Title: A streamlined workflow to analyze circadian data using Harmonic Regression
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 15-10-2026
Authors@R:
    person("Jayanth", "Sreekanth", email="jayanth.sreekanth@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-6569-1985"))
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0), BiocGenerics
Imports: Biobase, DESeq2, EDASeq, MatrixGenerics,
    NanoStringNCTools, RUVSeq, S4Vectors, SummarizedExperiment,
    boot, dplyr, limma, magrittr, rlang, scales, stringr
Suggests: 
    tidyverse,
    ggplot2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Description: A toolkit covering complete circadian data analysis workflow primarily for Nanostring nCounter data,
    encompassing everything from importing and processing to normalization, analysis and visualization. The regression 
    based analysis for estimating the confidence interval of amplitude is broadly applicable, not only for 
    gene-expression data, but also for other biological data. An informative visualization of results accompany 
    the analysis.
